WEBVTT

00:07:29.028 --> 00:07:33.616
Well, let's think a bit about what
we can actually say today

00:07:33.657 --> 00:07:35.784
about the origin of cities.

00:07:36.785 --> 00:07:40.164
Surely, you might think,
with the appearance of cities

00:07:40.206 --> 00:07:43.167
came the appearance of social classes.

00:07:43.167 --> 00:07:47.880
Think about ancient Egypt
with its pyramid temples.

00:07:47.922 --> 00:07:51.675
Or Shang China with its lavish tombs.

00:07:51.675 --> 00:07:54.887
The classic Maya
with their warlike rulers.

00:07:55.638 --> 00:07:59.683
Or the Inca empire with
its mummified kings and queens.